Recent kana gates shared Han characters. Numbered dates/counts differ from
relative or unnumbered references; 'every' is especially strong. Particle-fused
nouns respond less. Smaller families cover people, results and visual media,
and some modal/spatial words have negative responses. Uncovered words are zero.
